cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "MIDI Curves — MIDI velocity curves (VST3/CLAP plugin and standalone app)"
abstract: >-
  VST3/CLAP plugin and standalone app that maps the velocity of every MIDI
  Note On and Note Off through its own editable Bézier curve, like Curves in
  an image editor. Supports high-resolution (14-bit) velocity via the CC88
  prefix (MIDI CA-031) on input and output. Realtime path without locks or
  allocations, O(1) per note.
type: software
